Synthetic scorer self-test case: namespace-precedent-not-new

Task: T1 (score.ts --task T1)
Rules: S2, S5

Scenario
The precedent import is rewritten as `import * as orderRepo from "../orders/repository"`, and processPayment() calls orderRepo.findOrder().

Expected
Clean. S2 takes the symbol findOrder from the member access. At module level (S5) the tuple equals the BASE edge, so a rewritten import statement is not a new edge and nothing counts as repaired.

